@startuml
title Authentication and authorization in BrewLite
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
actor User
participant "Next.js UI" as UI
participant "NestJS auth / guards" as API
database PostgreSQL as DB
User -> UI: Submit email and password
UI -> API: POST /auth/login
API -> DB: Find normalized email and passwordHash
API -> API: bcrypt.compare
alt Invalid credentials
 API --> UI: 401, common error message
else Valid credentials
 API --> UI: Signed accessToken (7d) + public user fields
 UI -> UI: Persist auth state
end
User -> UI: Open protected function
UI -> API: Authorization: Bearer token
API -> API: JWT signature and expiry check
API -> DB: Read User by sub, current role
alt Invalid identity
 API --> UI: 401
else Valid identity
 API -> API: Attach request.user
 opt Staff endpoint
  API -> API: RolesGuard checks BARISTA metadata
 end
 API -> DB: Service checks ownership and business state
 API --> UI: Authorized result or appropriate rejection
end
note over UI, API: UI visibility and stored role do not grant backend permissions.
@enduml
